# MathTeam 接口调试示例（JetBrains HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client）
# 用法：先启动 uvicorn main:app --reload，再依次执行下面的请求。

### 1. 健康检查
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. 能力维度列表（无需登录）
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/capabilities
Accept: application/json

### 3. 登录拿 Token（表单提交，不是 JSON）
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=alice&password=123456

> {%
    client.global.set("alice_token", response.body.access_token);
%}

### 4. 我的画像（带 Bearer Token）
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/profile/me
Authorization: Bearer {{alice_token}}
Accept: application/json

### 5. 首页队伍卡片
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/recruitments/cards
Accept: application/json

### 6. 智能推荐（带理由）
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/recommendations/teams?top_k=5
Authorization: Bearer {{alice_token}}
Accept: application/json

### 7. 提交加入申请
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/applications/recruitments/1
Authorization: Bearer {{alice_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"message": "我看过论文写作相关经历，希望加入"}

### 8. 队长登录（审批用）
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=bob&password=123456

> {%
    client.global.set("bob_token", response.body.access_token);
%}

### 9. 队长查看申请
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/applications/teams/1
Authorization: Bearer {{bob_token}}
Accept: application/json

### 10. 运营统计（平台管理员）
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=admin&password=123456

> {%
    client.global.set("admin_token", response.body.access_token);
%}

###

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Accept: application/json
